Bind Npc 24418 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910128000
        Say "I am Degola, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! You have the [First Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "The Abyss Dungeon is located in Delos Castle famous for siege wars. What is the name of the dungeon lodged even deeper than the Abyss of Despair?"
            Topic "Abyss of the Underworld " do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910128000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [First Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
            Topic "Abyss of Hell" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910128000
                    Give 1 of 910129000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Degola, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
